{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>11月26日為大埔宏福苑火災一周年。天主教香港教區主教周守仁今（13日）向各堂區主任司鐸發信，籲請各堂區於火災一周年當日，為大埔宏福苑亡者奉獻彌撒，並在隨後的各台主日彌撒中，加入相關祈禱意向，為亡者及家屬祈禱。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:00:11.731534+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:21:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:53.085124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:53:35.427200+00:00","content_hash":"ba280f8e7440f804f5f556ecfc760ecb531be2c77fdca3818d68b564dae70a5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}